  m_text: 'SHADOW TILE ESCAPE

    Original design, programming, level design, UI,
    geometric game art, and generated feedback tones.


    NUNITO SANS

    Copyright
    The Nunito Sans Project Authors. Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
    The font and license are bundled with the game project.


    DEVELOPMENT TOOLING

    Made
    with AnkleBreaker MCP.


    OPENAI IMAGE GENERATION

    Original Shadow Tile
    Escape app icon generated for this project with OpenAI built-in ImageGen.


    UNITY
    PACKAGES

    Unity Engine, Universal Render Pipeline, Input System, TextMesh
    Pro, uGUI, Test Framework, Performance Testing, Mathematics, and their transitive
    Unity packages are used under their applicable Unity package terms.


    AUDIO
    & ART

    Ambient loop and interface cues are original editor-generated waveforms.
    All remaining UI geometry and icons are original project-authored assets. No
    paid or copied icon packs are used.'
